  "details": "Request to add a function to InputManager to check if a player is using One Handed Mode for added accessibility for worlds. `InputManager.IsOneHanded()`\n\nAn event would also be appreciated for knowing when a player's controller dies:\n\n```\n\npublic override void OnHandedModeChanged(bool value, UdonInputEventArgs args)\n\n{\n\n  Debug.Log($\"Is One Handed Mode = {value}\");\n\n  Debug.Log($\"Hand = {args.handType}\");\n\n}\n\n```",
